dist-perf/
.turbo/

# `tsc -b` from the repo root (see tsconfig.json's solution `references`, #46)
# writes one of these for the root project itself, outside any `dist/`. Every
# package's own is redirected into its `dist/` by `tsBuildInfoFile`, so this
# pattern is the catch-all for the ones that are not.
*.tsbuildinfo
*.local
.DS_Store
shots/

